# Zack Fair: "an Equipment that WAS attached to Zack Fair" is one that was attached to him as he left. Skullclamp was on Zack on
# turn 1 and equipped to the Ornithopter on turn 3 before the sacrifice, so it is not attached to him when he leaves: it stays on
# the Ornithopter (1/1) and is not moved to the Llanowar Elves he is sacrificed for, which gets only the counter and indestructible
# (2/2). Skullclamp does not draw, for the creature it equips did not die.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Zack Fair
Skullclamp
Llanowar Elves
Ornithopter
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x16

